      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A PEARL (1) recorded a 6 length win (25.05) in a Mix 3/4 last time at Shepparton. Has already won two times from this draw. Rates a leading player. ON THE PROWL (7) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at eight of 27 starts runs and has won two of last three, the latest winning (29.86) over 525m at this track. Strike rate this course strong having won five of nine tries. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. STORM HUSTLER (3) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around Wentworth Park in 29.48 to score two back then following on with a 25.69 win over 460m at Warragul. Flying lately and looks a key chance on that form. RETALIATION (5) best form can see him take this out.",
